  "details": "Under certain scenarios, the `Added` tag for an event will temporarily disappear, but will be corrected when the page refreshes.\n\nRepro:\n\n- Add an event to your calendar\n\n- Click on the event\n\n- Click `View Group`\n\n- Navigate back to your calendar by pressing the dedicated `Calendar` button in the header\n\n- Observe that the `Added` tag is missing from the event.\n\nVideo: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1s85eoy_h5ypnLMK5-qLYgNxhQOU237bA/view?usp=sharing",
